          "text": "Ino nkaambonzi ulaamba, O Jakobo? Nkaambonzi ulaamba makani, O Israyeli? Ulati, Inzila yangu tiiboneki kumeso aa-Jehova, alubeta lwangu lwaindilila kuzwa kuli-Leza wangu. ",
